{"assets":["/statement-assets/691659ec093b19d6d987d64d1e1ce742ae10688e02135bce80a9ac47f950417b.png","/statement-assets/888a02b1c101b3cef2d9d720e3685556c65653a1b9cd52a6cec87c10b27eb3e4.png","/statement-assets/5044e092348b97a52695548de159f93eab391b0a15c8a228473661e93f6b9ddf.png","/statement-assets/878a3c21a9596bc3c1abe698ef736fa97db789416e675ad118f3413a20d592fb.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1339","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A. Filling Diamonds"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You have integer $$$n$$$. Calculate how many ways are there to fully cover belt-like area of $$$4n-2$$$ triangles with diamond shapes. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Diamond shape consists of two triangles. You can move, rotate or flip the shape, but you cannot scale it. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$2$$$ coverings are different if some $$$2$$$ triangles are covered by the same diamond shape in one of them and by different diamond shapes in the other one."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Please look at pictures below for better understanding."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/691659ec093b19d6d987d64d1e1ce742ae10688e02135bce80a9ac47f950417b.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":" On the left you can see the diamond shape you will use, and on the right you can see the area you want to fill."},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/888a02b1c101b3cef2d9d720e3685556c65653a1b9cd52a6cec87c10b27eb3e4.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":" These are the figures of the area you want to fill for $$$n = 1, 2, 3, 4$$$. "}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You have to answer $$$t$$$ independent test cases."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains a single integer $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\le t \\le 10^{4}$$$) — the number of test cases."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each of the next $$$t$$$ lines contains a single integer $$$n$$$ ($$$1 \\le n \\le 10^{9}$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each test case, print the number of ways to fully cover belt-like area of $$$4n-2$$$ triangles using diamond shape. It can be shown that under given constraints this number of ways doesn't exceed $$$10^{18}$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n2\n2\n1\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n2\n1\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first test case, there are the following $$$2$$$ ways to fill the area:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/5044e092348b97a52695548de159f93eab391b0a15c8a228473661e93f6b9ddf.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second test case, there is a unique way to fill the area:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/878a3c21a9596bc3c1abe698ef736fa97db789416e675ad118f3413a20d592fb.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"A","problemCode":"1339A","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1339/problem/A"}